{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Roguelike Bullet Hell Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge relentless waves of enemy fire, upgrade your abilities and unleash devastating attacks in fast-paced, high-intensity battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473150/extras/GIF_1.gif?t=1742902109\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Adopt Kitties to Activate Synergies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rescue abandoned Kitties and train them to assist the Invaders, boosting power and unlocking special perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473150/extras/GIF_4.gif?t=1742902109\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create Unique Meows</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick from multiple <strong>Parasites and Cats</strong> to fuse into a one-of-a-kind warrior, each with its own skills and mutations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473150/extras/GIF_7.gif?t=1742902109\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Evolve Through Parasite Mutations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strengthen your Meows with game-changing abilities, unlocking devastating attacks and unpredictable evolutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473150/extras/GIF_5.gif?t=1742902109\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473150/extras/GIF_6.gif?t=1742902109\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on cockroaches, mice, dogs, elite military forces, tanks, jets, and even <strong>humanity\u2019s last hope: nuclear strikes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473150/extras/GIF_2.gif?t=1742902109\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will the <strong>Invaders</strong> wipe out humanity\u2026 or be stopped before total planetary domination? The war begins now!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3473150?t=1742902109","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473150/491ea8633ec8cad0ba6a1b7ceb71d610386d5c18/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742902109","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473150/f4aca6cf33ee45bf0821c2091eeeac3346f2b5d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742902109","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473150/f4aca6cf33ee45bf0821c2091eeeac3346f2b5d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742902109","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Roguelike Bullet Hell Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge relentless waves of enemy fire, upgrade your abilities and unleash devastating attacks in fast-paced, high-intensity battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473150/extras/GIF_1.gif?t=1742902109\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Adopt Kitties to Activate Synergies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rescue abandoned Kitties and train them to assist the Invaders, boosting power and unlocking special perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473150/extras/GIF_4.gif?t=1742902109\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create Unique Meows</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_pa